1
00:00:00,724 --> 00:00:04,224
(Sheldon:)Will you two please inform Amy
how much you enjoy

2
00:00:04,227 --> 00:00:06,557
(Sheldon:)adhering
to a strict bathroom schedule?

3
00:00:06,563 --> 00:00:07,593
(Amy:)- Can't.
- Won't.

4
00:00:07,597 --> 00:00:08,827
(Leonard:)- Didn't.
- Don't.

5
00:00:08,832 --> 00:00:10,102
(Amy:)I told you,

6
00:00:10,100 --> 00:00:12,900
(Amy:)you can't regulate every aspect
of our lives.

7
00:00:12,903 --> 00:00:16,673
(Sheldon:)I can if you'd just roll over
and accept your fate.

8
00:00:16,673 --> 00:00:19,143
(Amy:)I'm sorry
for bringing this over here.

9
00:00:19,142 --> 00:00:20,842
(Penny:)Believe me, we know
what you're going through.

10
00:00:20,844 --> 00:00:23,444
And I-I think the most helpful
thing we can tell you is

11
00:00:23,447 --> 00:00:24,667
(Leonard:)no backsies.

12
00:00:24,690 --> 00:00:26,480
(Penny:)Mm-hmm.

13
00:00:26,483 --> 00:00:27,813
(Amy:)Sheldon,
I understand

14
00:00:27,818 --> 00:00:29,248
(Amy:)that you like things
a certain way

15
00:00:29,252 --> 00:00:30,922
(Amy:)and I'm willing
to make some concessions,

16
00:00:30,921 --> 00:00:33,321
(Amy:)but you have to be open
to compromise.

17
00:00:33,323 --> 00:00:34,823
(Penny:)She's right.
That's reasonable.

18
00:00:34,825 --> 00:00:36,625
(Sheldon:)Oh, look who's in
favor of compromise,

19
00:00:36,626 --> 00:00:40,026
(Sheldon:)the woman who married
Leonard Hofstadter.

20
00:00:40,030 --> 00:00:42,260
(Leonard:)Hey, she didn't
compromise.

21
00:00:42,265 --> 00:00:44,935
(Leonard:)She settled.
There's a difference.

22
00:00:45,669 --> 00:00:48,199
(Penny:)Yeah. You tell him, babe.

23
00:00:48,205 --> 00:00:51,845
♪ Our whole universe
was in a hot, dense state ♪

